            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed the streaming splitter in engine/hookwire/posttooluse.go: the number, string-escape, literal and nesting-depth paths, duplicate and escaped field names, trailing-content rejection, and the envelope and 64 MiB bounds. I found no reachable defect. Tests in engine/hookwire/posttooluse_test.go cover as-sent hashing, invalid JSON, the envelope bound and a streamed 48 MiB response.",
